        <h1><span data-field="model_number">{{ model_number }}</span></h1>
        <h2>Rail-mount temperature transmitter</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
        <div class="main-content">
            <img src="placeholder_image.png" alt="Product Image" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div class="section-heading">Introduction</div>
            <p>The <span data-field="model_number">{{ model_number }}</span> with the <span data-field="output_spec">{{ output_spec }}</span> output and HART communications protocol has global approvals for explosion protection up to <span data-field="zone_rating">{{ zone_rating }}</span>. Safety-relevant applications up to <span data-field="sil_level">{{ sil_level }}</span> (redundant) are supported in accordance with <span data-field="standard_ref">{{ standard_ref }}</span>.</p>
            <p>The <span data-field="model_number">{{ model_number }}</span> features a universal sensor input for resistance thermometer, thermocouples, resistance and voltage measurement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-content">
            <div class="section-heading">Additional Information</div>
            <p>Temperature transmitter for the HART protocol.</p>
            <p>Suitable for all standard requirements.</p>
            <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Measurement made easy</h3>
            <p>Additional documentation on <span data-field="model_number">{{ model_number }}</span> is available for download free of charge at <span data-field="download_url">{{ download_url }}</span>.</p>
            <p>Alternatively simply scan this code:</p>
            <img src="placeholder_qr_code.png" alt="QR Code" style="width: 100px; height: 100px; margin-top: 10px;">
        </div>
    </div>
