            <p>Depending on the design, a specific marking in accordance with ATEX or IECEx applies.</p>
            <h4 class="sub-heading">ATEX intrinsic safety</h4>
            <p>The device fulfills the requirements of Directive 2014/34/EU in case of corresponding purchase orders and is approved for use in Zone 0, 1 and 2.</p>
            <h4 class="sub-heading">IECEx intrinsic safety</h4>
